From: GPTware AI Team <dcmaxhome@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:45:42 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 17/18] MoE: shared expert of wide verify windows as one pass
 (EXL3_MOE_SHARED_WIDE, default off)

Verify windows wider than MAX_BSZN rows (multi-user rounds) ran the shared expert's 8-row graph once per 8-row
piece: 8 gate/up + 8 down launches per layer at 64 rows. BC_GatedMLP::run_wide runs any row count as one ungraphed
pass (one gate/up mgemm, the activation, one down GEMM). Not bit-identical to the pieces (one GEMM over all rows
tiles differently: max |diff| 4e-5..2e-4 at 9-64 rows); top-1 and KL at the noise floor.
